---
description: KVKK (Turkish data protection law) audit of the codebase. Use when the user asks for a KVKK audit, a Turkish data protection review, "can I launch in Turkey?", "KVKK denetimi" or "kişisel veri denetimi".
alwaysApply: false
---

To run a KVKK audit, read `skills/kvkk-audit/SKILL.md` and follow it step by step, including
`skills/kvkk-audit/references/workflow.md`. The skill directory is `skills/kvkk-audit/` (or wherever
the `kvkk-audit` skill is installed in this project). Do not audit from memory: the rules, the
report format and the disclaimer are defined only in the skill files.
